ated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-22T05:25:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Fix inconsistent path separators in error and warning logs on Windows\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nOn Windows systems, error and warning logs display file paths with mixed backslashes (`\\`) and forward slashes (`/`). This occurs because paths are not normalized before logging. Example logs:\r\n\r\n\r\n<summary>Collision Warning Example</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n// core/templates/a_hash_map.h:190\r\nWARNING: Excessive collision count (13), is the right hash function being used?\r\n   at: AHashMap<class String,...>::_insert_with_hash (C:\\Users\\user\\godot\\core/templates/a_hash_map.h:190)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<summary>Input Error</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nERROR: Condition \"button == MouseButton::NONE\" is true. Returning: MouseButtonMask::NONE\r\n   at: mouse_button_to_mask (C:\\Users\\user\\godot\\core/input/input_enums.h:136)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n### Path Normalization\r\n- Replaced backslashes (`\\`) with forward slashes (`/`) in logging functions.\r\n- Added path normalization before passing paths to logging systems.\r\n\r\n### Memory Safety\r\n- Explicitly stored `CharString` objects to extend buffer lifetime.\r\n- Prevented dangling pointers via proper lifetime management.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104471/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104471/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}